WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.350
<b>Used Bookstore Hitotose</b>

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:07.110
And hup... and hup...

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.160
There we go!

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:14.040
Hina-chan, thanks for helping me 
even though it's summer break.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.120
No, I'm doing this <i>because</i> it's summer break.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.120
<i>I was actually able to speak in front 
of people at the culture festival.</i>

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.710
<i>Right now, I bet I could 
wait on customers, too!</i>

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:26.780
So, what should I do?

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:31.170
Well, I'd like you to help me 
set out and restock merchandise.

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:33.010
Sure. Leave it to me!

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:07.980
<b>Trying Too Hard</b>

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:12.360
<b>Used Bookstore Hitotose</b>

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:12.360
Hina-chan, do you want to 
practice waiting on customers?

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:14.220
Yeah, I do!

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:18.120
Okay, try doing what you'd do 
if a customer came in.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:18.860
Right!

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:22.850
W-Welcome!

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:27.100
We have old books, 
rare books... lots of books!

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:30.250
Please take your time looking around!

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:33.040
That was very good!

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:35.750
Really? I did it right?

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:36.760
Yeah!

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:38.300
I'm so glad!

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.480
Um, excuse me.

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:44.890
There's a book I'm looking for...

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:48.080
Welcome. We'll be right with you.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.290
Hina-cha—

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:55.770
U-Um, w-we'll be right with you...

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:59.950
I need to do something with these...

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.660
There we go.

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:05.440
S-Sorry for the wait!

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:07.410
S-Sure...

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:10.630
Thank you for coming!

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:14.740
I was so nervous...

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:17.540
I couldn't help the customer at all.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:19.910
Hey, that was only the first one.

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:21.680
You'll get used to it eventually.

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.050
I'm back.

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:27.920
Hina-chan, that's just Mayu-chan!

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:29.560
Oh, you're right...

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.440
What's wrong?

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.440
Oh, nothing...

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:35.540
Anyway, where's Aki-chan?

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.210
The landlady?

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:39.820
She came back, then headed right out again.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.540
What? Where'd she go?

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:42.850
I'm not sure.

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:45.700
It seemed like she was going to 
hang out with some theater buddies.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:48.240
Did you need her for something?

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:51.000
No, nothing in particular...

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:55.330
It's just that the two of us
 haven't hung out lately.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:58.110
You're lonely because she 
hasn't paid attention to you?

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:02.420
Eh? O-Of course not! I'm not a child!

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.220
There's no need to bluff.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.470
I'm not bluffing!

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:09.700
I don't know about that.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:10.850
There, there.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:14.480
Darn it! You're ganging up on me!

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:22.240
<b>Used Bookstore Hitotose</b>

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:18.060
Anyway, are you guys hungry?

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:20.480
Why don't we take a break and have some tea?

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:22.240
We'd love some!

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:28.890
You're back to your usual look.

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:32.120
Seeing you dressed 
like a maid just feels right.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.400
You like frilly clothes, right?

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.690
I'd love to see you in a dress.

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:40.000
I bet you'd look good in lolita fashion, too.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.630
A dress...

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.060
Lolita...

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:49.260
I couldn't do that! No way!

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:52.640
<i>How would it be any different 
from what she's wearing now?</i>

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:55.150
Hey, Hinako! Are you here?

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:57.430
Yua-sama is here to see you!

00:04:57.430 --> 00:04:58.650
You'd better thank...

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.050
Welcome!

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:02.010
Hinako, what's with you?

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.780
Hina-chan, that's Yua-chan.

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.660
Oh, it's just you, Yua-chan!

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:10.280
Are you trying to pick a fight?

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.580
So you really do run a café, too.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.790
Go on, Yua-chan, help yourself.

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:23.220
So everyone living in the apartments
here also works in the shop?

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:24.810
Do you work, too, Hinako?

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:25.670
Yep!

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:29.280
I can't imagine you handling 
the work of a waitress, though.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.510
She can do it!

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.860
But I bet she spills tea all the time, right?

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:35.520
No, she doesn't!

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:36.730
Right, Hina-chan?

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:37.310
Huh?

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:41.830
Well, if that's what you say, 
then let's see you do it.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:42.660
Huh?!

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:43.920
Go on, Hina-chan!

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:45.540
Show her what a great job you can do!

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:47.200
Huh?!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.600
Safe!

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:00.900
The tea is, maybe.

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.210
<b>Milk</b>

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.120
I'm sorry!

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:06.220
O-Oh, no!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.260
Yua-chan, you're so cute!

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:17.060
Sorry this was all I had.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.210
We'll have your outfit cleaned,

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:22.610
so could you wear this for now?

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:27.310
Jeez... I can't let people 
see me dressed like this...

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:28.880
That's not true at all!

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:30.440
You look really cute!

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.120
Yeah, you do!

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:41.880
I'm back.

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:45.090
Oh, Aki-chan. Welcome back.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.530
Where'd you go?

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:47.260
Oh...

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:51.760
I went to see some people 
from my old theater troupe,

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:55.510
and I lost track of time 
while talking to them.

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:57.520
That's fine,

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.110
but you could have sent me 
a message before you left.

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:02.020
Yeah... Sorry.

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:04.270
I'll do that next time.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:08.280
<i>Ch-Chiaki-senpai looks so beautiful today...</i>

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.800
There, there.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:11.160
<i>It's so rare to see her in a skirt!</i>

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:13.730
<i>She's my idol!</i>

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:16.540
Oh, Yua-chan, you're here?

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:18.070
<i>Wow...</i>

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:21.750
<i>Yua-chan's regular clothes are 
a lot more unique than I expected...</i>

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:23.650
<i>So cute...</i>

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:25.110
<i>So beautiful...</i>

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:28.260
Are you two okay?

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.260
By the way,

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:33.640
what brings you here, Yua-chan?

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:38.020
Oh, right, I came to lend you some DVDs.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.640
Performances by my favorite 
small theater troupes,

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:43.650
and acting lessons on DVD!

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:46.190
Watch these and study them carefully.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:48.530
Huh? I can borrow those?

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.580
Aren't they important to you?

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:53.160
I-It's no big deal!

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:56.030
If you don't get better, 
I'll have no competition.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:59.060
And as a fellow actress 
in the Hitotose Troupe...

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:03.170
Thanks, Yua-chan!

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.440
D-Don't get the wrong idea, okay?!

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:06.360
It's not for you—

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:08.550
You really are nice, Yua-chan!

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:11.250
I told you not to get the wrong idea!

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:14.740
They're more like a mother and child 
than fellow actresses.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:12.770
Thanks!

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:15.340
Like I said, I'm not doing this for you!

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:15.830
Yeah.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:16.430
I'll be sure to watch them.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:25.760
Today was a lot of fun. I even 
got to spend time with Yua-chan.

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:29.440
I can't believe she came to see me, 
even though it's summer break.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:33.320
And as a fellow actress 
in the Hitotose Troupe...

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:38.330
I'm so happy to be part of a group 
of friends who help each other.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.750
It's too early to go to bed,

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:46.330
so I'll watch just a little bit 
of the DVDs Yua-chan lent me.

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:49.590
Huh...

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:02.850
I'll watch this and do my best 
to aim for the Suzuran stage!

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:09.010
Help me, Yua-chan!

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:11.040
You can't even play a DVD?!

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:13.990
Just how deep in the 
countryside did you live?!

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:22.410
<b>Coffee Shop</b>

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:31.170
Oh, w-welcome!

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:33.920
Help yourself to an open seat.

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:38.340
<i>Maybe I'll be able to manage today.</i>

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:41.180
<i>I have to do my best 
to help out after this, too.</i>

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.350
Hina-chan!

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:43.490
Yes!

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:46.060
Would you go and take the customer's order?

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.060
Okay.

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:53.320
H-Have you decided 
wh-what you'd like to order?

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:55.060
Yes, thank you.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:56.190
You can do it, Hina-chan!

00:09:56.190 --> 00:09:59.270
W-Will that be all?

00:09:59.270 --> 00:09:59.820
Yes.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:05.950
Th-Then please wait a... a... moment...

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:12.840
H-Hina-chan!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:14.600
A-Are you okay?!

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:27.250
37.5 degrees...

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:29.730
Looks like Hina-chan caught a cold.

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:32.370
Do you think we should take her to a clinic?

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:34.600
Maybe we should contact her parents, too!

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:37.640
Calm down. It's just a mild fever.

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:39.860
Let's just keep an eye on her.

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:44.480
You can go on and get back to work.

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:46.500
I'll take care of her.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:50.130
O-Okay. Sorry I lost my cool.

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:52.290
Is it true that Hina-chan passed out?!

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:54.320
Sh-Should I call an ambulance?!

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:56.400
Or should I carry her myself?!

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:58.300
You need to calm down, too, Kuu-chan.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:05.080
Thank goodness! You're awake!

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:08.300
Kuu-chan... What did I...

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:11.380
You came down with a fever and 
passed out while waiting on a customer.

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:13.630
What? Who's working the coffee shop?

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:16.320
Mayu-chan is handling it on her own for now.

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:19.460
I'll be going to help her later.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:23.430
I-I'm sorry.

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:25.120
It's all because of me.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.330
It's okay. Don't worry about a thing.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:30.760
Hina-chan, is there anything 
we can get for you?

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:35.040
I feel a little cold,

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.340
so something warm might be nice.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:41.300
In that case, I'll warm you 
with my own body right now!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.590
I'm warm-blooded!

00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:45.120
How's that, Hina-chan?

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.900
Are you warm now?

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:49.600
Yeah, v-very warm...

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:54.350
You know you can't do that. 
We need to let her rest.

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:58.110
H-Hina-chan, I'll be back later!

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:00.030
Just hang tight!

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:03.110
That surprised me.

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.540
Can I take your order?

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:06.150
I'll clean that up right away!

00:12:08.030 --> 00:12:09.890
Ta-da! You here, Hinako?

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:12.870
Yua-sama brought more DVDs to lend you...

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.630
Oh, Yua-chan.

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:18.500
What? Hinako caught a cold and passed out?

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:22.680
Yes, so I'm looking up things 
that help with colds.

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:24.220
To cure a cold...

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:31.140
<b>Dictionary of Medicines</b>

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:27.080
Of course! She needs medicine, right?

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.140
We can cure Hina-chan with this!

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:38.230
Here we go...

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:40.660
You're doing it wrong.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:48.070
Hina-chan, I brought something 
that'll help your cold!

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:51.830
Ta-da! Say goodbye to your cold with this!

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:53.950
Huh? A green onion?

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:57.080
Yeah. Apparently you 
wrap it around your neck.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.850
I saw it in a book.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:01.460
So let's wrap it around your neck right now!

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:07.970
Something just doesn't seem right...

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.380
Yeah. It's bound to take at least that much.

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:14.850
I-Isn't that too many?

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:17.520
The more, the better! Everyone knows that!

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.290
Even if she gets hungry and eats some,

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:21.220
there's plenty to spare!

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:24.360
Well, I guess you do have a point there...

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:28.480
What else can we do?

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:30.040
Oh, I know!

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:31.250
They say that when you have a cold,

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:33.250
you should sweat it out!

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:40.250
What is all this?

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:50.640
Really, you two should know better.

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:53.640
You made Hina-chan feel even worse.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:55.270
We're sorry.

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:58.290
I feel alive again.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:00.400
Really? I'm glad.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.890
Since you got sweaty,

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:13.590
I'll wipe you down.

00:14:13.590 --> 00:14:15.290
O-Okay...

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:21.060
Sorry. Is it too cold?

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:24.050
N-No, it's fine...

00:14:26.020 --> 00:14:27.670
There, all done.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:31.050
Th-Thank you.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:39.490
Okay, we'll be downstairs.

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:40.500
If you need anything,

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.290
call us with your cell phone.

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:43.250
Okay.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:12.110
Hina-chan, you don't have to worry anymore.

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:17.940
I found a surefire method used all around 
the world to cure sickness instantly.

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:19.350
There...

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:22.850
Hiss!

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:26.120
What are you doing?

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:29.200
A bite from the Great White Snake 
cures any illness—

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:30.920
If it's the real one.

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:45.940
Gods, hear my prayer...

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.570
I was just, um... I mean...

00:15:49.570 --> 00:15:51.330
Don't make so much noise.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:52.080
Okay.

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.200
Rawr!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:08.850
A bite from a dragon cures any illness—

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:11.300
Again, only if it's a real one.

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:25.720
Elohim essaim... Elohim essaim... 
I implore you...

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:27.170
This is just, um...

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.220
What good will it do to summon a demon?

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:31.720
Oops, wrong chant!

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:39.020
You two aren't allowed to go 
into Hina-chan's room anymore.

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:40.160
B-But...

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:41.730
I'm worried about Hinako...

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:43.380
I understand,

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:46.480
but the best thing we can do 
for her now is to let her rest quietly.

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:49.230
You're right.

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:50.970
Hey, you guys!

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:53.610
Could you help me with something?

00:17:01.890 --> 00:17:04.210
It's so quiet...

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:14.830
I think this is the first time
 I've been sick since I came to Tokyo.

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:18.890
How many years has it been 
since I caught a cold, anyway?

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:22.190
Hey, Hina-chan! Good work again.

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:22.560
After I started working as a scarecrow,

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:23.660
Thanks for helping out every day.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:25.640
I spent all my time in 
the field with no breaks.

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:25.640
Here are your vegetables for today.

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:31.280
Has it been since first grade?

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:35.090
Mom spent the whole day looking after me,

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:37.660
and she made rice gruel for me...

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:50.140
I wonder if Mom is at home right now...

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.920
<b>Mom</b>

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:52.370
I wonder if she'll answer the phone...

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:57.010
I miss you, Mom...

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:01.510
I want to eat your rice gruel...

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:04.000
No, Hinako!

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.660
If I show her any weakness,

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:08.510
she'll tell me to come home!

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:13.770
I decided I wouldn't go home 
until I started acting in Tokyo

00:18:13.770 --> 00:18:15.940
and got over my scarecrow problem!

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:21.500
But for today...

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:23.530
Just for today...

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:26.810
Hina-chan?

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:28.290
How are you feeling?

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.040
Eh? Ah...

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:32.720
You're not sleeping! Are you okay?

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:35.920
U-Uh... This is just, um... I...

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:38.440
Hina-chan, do you feel hungry?

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:38.930
Huh?

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.870
We all made some rice gruel.

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:43.050
Do you think you can eat?

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:48.310
Yeah! I'll have some!

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:54.630
I was the one who cut up the 
pickled plum so it'd be easier to eat!

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:57.250
And I cut up the seaweed.

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:59.320
Thanks, both of you!

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:04.330
Here. Say, "Ahh."

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:10.020
It's delicious!

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:11.960
Oh, good.

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:14.820
Strange...

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:17.920
It tastes just like my mom's.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.470
Why is that?

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:22.740
Well... I wonder...

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:24.580
Yeah, I wonder why.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:29.760
Maybe it's because we made it 
with the same feelings your mom did?

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:31.480
The same feelings?

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:37.230
We all made it with the wish 
that your cold would get better soon.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.720
You guys...

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:54.250
Thank you!

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.650
Can you eat more?

00:19:56.650 --> 00:19:58.460
Yeah! I'll have more!

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:00.270
I'll eat all of it!

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:02.570
As long as you don't 
get sick to your stomach.

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:04.680
Oh, I'll feed you next.

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:06.800
Say, "Ahh."

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:10.930
It's my turn next!

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:17.350
S-Say, "Ahh."

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:21.690
D-Do you like it?

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:24.570
Yeah! It tastes delicious!

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:26.480
Okay, I'll go next.

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:28.140
Wait! I want another turn!

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:30.380
No fair going twice in a row.

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:31.830
Why not?!

00:20:36.270 --> 00:20:37.740
<i>Mom...</i>

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:42.540
<i>I felt a little homesick today 
because of my cold,</i>

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:46.090
<i>but thanks to everyone here, 
I didn't feel lonely.</i>

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:49.250
<i>Meeting such wonderful new friends</i>

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:52.480
<i>makes me glad I moved to Tokyo.</i>

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:05.860
Okay!

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:09.060
Good morning, everyone!

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:11.490
Thanks to you guys, I'm all bet— huh?

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.550
Th-This is awful!

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:22.340
What should I do?

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:26.760
No! This time, I'm the one 
who needs to work hard!

00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:36.860
Towel, towel, towel...

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:40.500
Fresh clothes, fresh clothes, 
fresh clothes...

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:43.780
And water... Water...

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:45.780
<b>Oral Medicine 
Nakajima Yua 
Directions 
Take 3 per day for 7 days.</b>

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:53.360
I wonder if Hinako feels better...

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:34.220
<b>We'll Have a Training Camp</b>

00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:29.570
Hina-chan's mom is going to come visit soon!

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:33.550
And the Hitotose Troupe will finally 
hold its first performance!

00:23:33.550 --> 00:23:37.030
All we can do to make it successful 
is practice, practice, practice!

00:23:37.030 --> 00:23:39.170
Next time, "We'll Have a Training Camp."
